Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.90,0:00:05.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed! Al! Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This chromium-molybdenum steel spanner set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:11.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the hydraulic torque wrench, and that micrometer, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.49,0:00:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, and pick me out whichever ultra-hard tip drill and bit you think is suitable!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.07,0:00:16.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, you got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.49,0:00:18.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just what you'd expect to \Nfind in a tool store in Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.78,0:00:21.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their selection is far different \Nfrom what's out in the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:25.45,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Ah, I can't get over how good the walnut handle on this screwdriver feels under my fingers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:27.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, are you still buying things, Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you think this is a bit much in the way of souvenirs for your grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.54,0:00:34.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you said you'd buy me anything, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:35.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:36.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah! Those are high-carbon chromium-steel cutting pliers, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll cut through anything and never rust!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I buy these as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:46.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.51,0:00:49.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:51.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Would you throw in this sewing machine oil too?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.18,0:00:53.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.21,0:00:55.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Without me around, make sure you take care of your Automail!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:08.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Col. Mustang wants to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:10.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A mission for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:13.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Now that you're a State Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:17.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you'll be called upon to go on missions, \Nso be ready for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.32,0:01:18.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Hawkeye?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.54,0:01:24.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here are your orders and materials.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fullmetal Alchemist Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:33.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The above-mentioned is hereby ordered to inspect the coal mine at Youswell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:38.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stuff like this is the job of a State Alchemist?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.32,0:01:40.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It includes investigating the mined resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.02,0:01:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As an alchemist, you have knowledge of ores, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.58,0:01:49.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your first mission, so I arranged for your task to be simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.45,0:01:52.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't let yourself get careless just because of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything \Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:02:01.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything, \Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.90,0:02:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's \NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.63,0:02:12.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that \Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.05,0:04:03.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's almost like the whole train was reserved, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Traveling by train is nice, huh? All you have to do is sit, and—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:08.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:12.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is my job, now that \NI'm a dog of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.56,0:04:15.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You didn't have to come along too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.02,0:04:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you still saying that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll always be together \Nwith you, Brother! After all...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.88,0:04:23.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're coming back to the village sometime, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.59,0:04:25.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we're not going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:26.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.99,0:04:30.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, there's no longer any home for us to return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.60,0:04:35.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.98,0:04:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, it's coming into view!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.59,0:04:44.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's the last town to the east, \NYouswell Coal Mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:52.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a coal mine, I thought there'd be more activity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.81,0:04:57.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone looks burned-out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.26,0:04:59.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like there's much to see here either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, let's do this inspection quickly and go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:05.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.28,0:05:05.33,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Oww!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.33,0:05:06.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you tourists?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.12,0:05:09.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are you from?!\NHave you eaten? Where are you staying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.74,0:05:13.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:13.10,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Pop! We've got visitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.75,0:05:17.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Visitors! Visitors! \NSome big spenders are here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Big spenders?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:20.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice of you to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.20,0:05:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm the inn's manager, Halling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.26,0:05:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry the place is so dusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The coal mine's wages are pretty low.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But with this place, \NI've got two irons in the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.80,0:05:33.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now then, overnight \Naccommodations for two?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:35.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are your rates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.31,0:05:36.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're steep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.56,0:05:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not to worry. Despite how we look, we have plenty of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.75,0:05:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:46.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000?! Don't be ridiculous! \NThat much for just a night's stay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.74,0:05:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ours is the highest-class inn in all of Youswell, such that it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.54,0:05:52.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, it's the same price no matter where you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:56.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We haven't had any guests in a long time! \NWe have to soak you good!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.90,0:06:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.78,0:06:04.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry had us buy all of those presents for her grandma, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.80,0:06:06.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's nothing else we can do. \NAt this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incredible! It's the way it used to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.69,0:06:14.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks brand-new!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.70,0:06:17.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is there anything else I can fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, if I could ask you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something I hold dear, but accidentally broke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.98,0:06:24.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, you still haven't thrown that away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:27.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You so rarely buy me anything, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.50,0:06:29.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, let me handle it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.97,0:06:35.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:37.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's pretty nice, Hostess!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How delightful! To think that our first guest in so long would be an alchemist!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:43.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I took a crack at it once too,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.80,0:06:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but I didn't have the talent for it, so I gave it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, what did you come to Youswell for? There's nothing here for anyone to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:53.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm here on business. \NI came to inspect the coal mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.81,0:06:58.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.15,0:06:59.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're with the military?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.81,0:07:03.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am... a State Alchemist, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.20,0:07:08.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That hurt! What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:11.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have any food or beds to give to any dogs of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you a soldier too?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:15.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:17.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's got nothing to do with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.60,0:07:19.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just got together on the train here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.30,0:07:22.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.64,0:07:25.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can go get yourself eaten by dogs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.38,0:07:31.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was some incredible hatred, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.49,0:07:34.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, sure it was! Everyone hates military people, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.64,0:07:38.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That guy Yoki, who supervises this place, is a fiend for money. He's the worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.93,0:07:39.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:44.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And now, he's joined by that State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.94,0:07:47.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Alchemist, be thou for the People."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.94,0:07:49.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's both common sense to them, and their pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:51.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what I've come to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.03,0:07:53.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mister...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.37,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I can't stand those who sell their souls to the military in exchange for special privileges.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm starving...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry, you could worry about the \Nhuman part instead of the machine
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.65,0:08:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,once in a while too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:16.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She does worry about you, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:18.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I snuck this out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:19.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.00,0:08:21.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't eat, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.68,0:08:25.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Soldiers really are despised, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.06,0:08:27.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm prepared for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.48,0:08:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should get certified too, \Nas a State Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.01,0:08:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's bad enough that I have to go through this by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:41.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Besides, I really have become a dog of the military, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:42.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.66,0:08:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stand aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your shop is as filthy as ever, Halling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.10,0:08:52.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, well, if it isn't Lt. Yoki. \NWelcome to my decrepit establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.37,0:08:53.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Enough pleasantries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.84,0:08:57.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The taxes on your place are overdue.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:00.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And it's not just you, I could say the same for the whole town.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I apologize. My earnings are so little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:06.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is because your work is so poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.10,0:09:06.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:09.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the ones who lowered our wages, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.10,0:09:11.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of that, you raised our taxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Yoki has been placed in charge of this coal mine by Central!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.28,0:09:18.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You just took the money that we sweat bullets to earn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:20.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and used it to bribe them to promote you, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.59,0:09:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hmph! So why don't you try offering tribute to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.90,0:09:29.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The world is not a place where everything is provided for you on a silver platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:33.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You bastard! I can't put up \Nwith any more of this today!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.16,0:09:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nicely done, Lyra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems that the stories of this shop
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:55.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,becoming a hangout for troublemakers have turned out to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:58.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, I will have to think about suspending your business license.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.90,0:09:59.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.00,0:10:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.76,0:10:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.50,0:10:09.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Make an example of him. Hurt him just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.08,0:10:10.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.44,0:10:25.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I heard the Lieutenant would be coming by,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.90,0:10:28.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so I thought I'd say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:29.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:31.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who is this kid, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.77,0:10:34.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You idiot! You don't even \Nknow about State Alchemists?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're an organization under \Nthe direct control of the Führer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:41.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my, how terribly \Nrude of my subordinate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:44.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Yoki, the one who runs this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.78,0:10:47.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er, what business might you have in coming to our rural town?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm just here to conduct an inspection.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.32,0:10:51.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An inspection?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:54.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only you had contacted me, \NI would've sent someone to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.65,0:10:58.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted, right? \NCome, come, please stay at my mansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.83,0:11:03.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miserable dogs of the military!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.43,0:11:10.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Mustang-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear you're going to \Nbecome a full colonel soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hawkeye-kun, I hear you're going to be promoted to 1st Lieutenant too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:18.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, General Hakuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.56,0:11:20.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder, once your authority increases,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:24.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,if you would go to the Eastern Command\NCenter and take charge of it for a while?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're demoting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:29.07,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,{\fscx92}I suppose having someone like me around Central does—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.63,0:11:29.07,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.07,0:11:32.25,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,This isn't a demotion. It's a transfer to a higher post, {\i1}Colonel{\i0} Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.02,0:11:35.88,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,However, I've heard there are a good number of untrustworthy folks in the Eastern Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be sure to watch yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:43.50,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,I am greatly honored that a State Alchemist \Nshould come visit my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.50,0:11:47.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes indeed. Since we have such an exceptional alchemist among us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.07,0:11:51.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra, have him take \Na look at your alchemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.10,0:11:52.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:53.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nah, I saw it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.44,0:11:57.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She liquefied the air around her, \Nreduced its volume,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:00.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and then all at once vaporized it again, \Nproducing a shockwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:05.23,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,The light came from the extreme heat that was created by the forced compression, to maintain entropy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.23,0:12:07.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You figured all that out \Nwith just a glance?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.93,0:12:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I, too, would like to be certified as a State Alchemist
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.36,0:12:13.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and become like you, Edward-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.40,0:12:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:15.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:19.63,Dialogue,,20,20,0,,It is my dream to become an outstanding alchemist, \Nand do all that I can for the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.88,0:12:24.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, please feel free to eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.02,0:12:27.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hope that our rural cooking will agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You eat well, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.96,0:12:32.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Despite the town being in this shape...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you embarrass me! \NThe tax collecting has not been going well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I don't know \Nwhat I'm going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:42.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On top of that, there are so many \Nbarbaric residents here, as you saw earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:46.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mean, all they do is assert their rights and neglect their duty to pay their taxes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:51.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, indeed, Edward-sama, \Nyou are a man of understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.22,0:12:54.76,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,You can express all the reasoning of the world \Nin terms of equivalent exchange,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.76,0:12:57.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the basis of alchemy, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.95,0:13:00.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rights come with responsibilities, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.38,0:13:03.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Certainly! Mm, most wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.25,0:13:06.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As such, I wonder if you would accept this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.50,0:13:08.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,by way of the reasoning of the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.73,0:13:09.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lyra?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:14.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It is only a small token. \NPlease accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.44,0:13:16.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this what you would call a bribe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.65,0:13:18.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's far too direct a way of putting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.55,0:13:21.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you'd like, call it an equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.27,0:13:25.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if you would please consider the matter of the inspection...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:28.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I should have known that you would be so understanding, Edward-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The folks in town should start \Nbehaving themselves soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.75,0:13:37.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so if you would care to wait briefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:44.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Brother is all right on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.02,0:13:50.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.81,0:14:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! Khayal is still in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.07,0:14:06.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can't, boss! It's too dangerous! \NThere's no telling when it'll collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:14.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.24,0:14:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.65,0:14:21.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Khayal! Khayal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.18,0:14:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.75,0:14:29.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this their doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:47.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, you're a cracker-jack alchemist, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.50,0:14:50.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So then, transmute some gold for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then you can help my pop...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.02,0:14:54.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You could save the whole town for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.83,0:14:55.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?! You don't lose anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.93,0:15:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The basis of alchemy is equivalent exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.12,0:15:04.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have neither the duty nor the obligation to do anything for this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.12,0:15:08.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you telling us to bribe you as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:10.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself an alchemist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:15.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Alchemist, be thou for the People," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:20.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Transmuting gold is a serious offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.05,0:15:23.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I get caught, I'll be stripped of \Nmy State Alchemist certification,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.87,0:15:25.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and sent to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.26,0:15:26.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, do it so no one finds out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.54,0:15:30.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if I do make gold, it'll just be taken in taxes, and that'll be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.98,0:15:32.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're really that hard up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:36.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,why don't you leave this town and go find some other work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:39.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you may not understand this,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.75,0:15:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but this place is our home, and our coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is your home and coffin, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.79,0:15:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:58.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, we burned down our home ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:02.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have nowhere to return to, \Nand that's all right by us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.02,0:16:04.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But for people who do have somewhere they call home,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.44,0:16:06.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,they have to look out for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.86,0:16:12.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, what you see here will be our secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.74,0:16:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.86,0:16:26.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You want to buy the coal mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.88,0:16:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah! I want you to include everything from the mine to the trade routes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.71,0:16:32.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:37.10,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Well... even at the request of a State Alchemist, that's just something I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.10,0:16:40.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see. That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.52,0:16:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And here I got all this money ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.80,0:16:46.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,all gold?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.28,0:16:50.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Upon investigation, \Nit turns out that this mine
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:53.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,had unexploited elements that we use in alchemy research.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.44,0:16:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't want to turn it \Nover to anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.82,0:16:59.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.03,0:17:03.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, my selling the mine that \NI was entrusted by the state to govern
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.35,0:17:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for my own profit will look a little...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:09.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all right! This gold doesn't appear on any records,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.78,0:17:13.14,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,so as long as you keep your lips sealed, \Nyou can get by without anyone else knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.17,0:17:20.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please write up a memo handing over all authority over the coal mine for no charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.75,0:17:25.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By doing that, this will be \Nall yours, Lieutenant Yoki.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.24,0:17:31.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.15,0:17:32.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you stopping me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.40,0:17:34.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just am! I will not allow you to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:37.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they were the ones who demolished the store!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.42,0:17:39.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just one store.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.20,0:17:40.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't get so fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.24,0:17:45.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi, everybody! I'm here to cheer up \Nthose gloomy faces of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.25,0:17:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.10,0:17:51.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, now, is that any way to \Ntalk to the manager of this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.63,0:17:54.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Manager?! Why, you! \NWhat have you—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:58.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As you can see, this is the title deed for the mining, trade, management,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:00.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and all other rights \Nto this coal mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.47,0:18:01.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:05.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In other words, right now, \Nthis coal mine belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:07.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:11.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have to go back to Central.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:13.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It would be a nuisance to have to \Ncarry this title deed back with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.95,0:18:15.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.82,0:18:19.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're \Ntrying to sell that to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.03,0:18:20.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll cost an arm and a leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:22.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whenever you wish to gain anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,you have to pay for it with something of appropriate value, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.46,0:18:29.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After all, not only is this title deed written on high-grade parchment,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.00,0:18:31.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,it also has gold leaf trim.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:33.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more, the box \Nfeatures finely crushed jade,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.65,0:18:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,in a nonchalant yet luxurious design.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is real craftsmanship, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.32,0:18:42.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, and the key is made of sterling silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.35,0:18:45.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gee, I would roughly estimate that it's worth 200,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000?! For the deed to the coal mine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:50.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,200,000?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.08,0:18:51.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's all?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.81,0:18:55.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come to mention it, the foreman's inn \Ncost 200,000, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about I spend the night and we call it even?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.68,0:19:00.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Equivalent exchange, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But our inn has been...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.54,0:19:06.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Well then, \Nwhat's that over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.04,0:19:11.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.48,0:19:13.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can this be?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.54,0:19:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This will be enough to \Ncover me staying here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, of course it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.55,0:19:21.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then it's an equivalent exchange!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.44,0:19:24.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.55,0:19:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The gold bars that I got from you \Nhave all turned to stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gold bars? Why, whatever are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.36,0:19:32.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please don't play dumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.77,0:19:35.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I traded you that title deed \Nfor a mountain of gold bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.77,0:19:40.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? You handed over the deed free of charge, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Look, I even have the memo here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:44.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You swindled me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.96,0:19:48.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Swindled" makes it sound so scandalous. It was a legitimate transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.75,0:19:51.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The transaction is invalid! Lyra!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:02.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alchemist, be thou for the People!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:05.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't much care for you using \Nalchemy for your own interests!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.09,0:20:07.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a State Alchemist, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.32,0:20:09.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why would you go against what the military is doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:20.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never sold my soul to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:48.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Get the title deed back from—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.34,0:20:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoki-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.26,0:20:58.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take other people's personal property from them by force, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.51,0:21:02.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Never underestimate the strength of a coal mining man, Lieutenant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.24,0:21:10.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Saké! Saké! Bring us some saké!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.73,0:21:15.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, honey, isn't the shop \Na little better than before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.25,0:21:17.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. He really did a number here...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.49,0:21:23.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric, the Fullmetal Alchemist.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.17,0:21:27.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the report from Edward Elric.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:28.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.68,0:21:32.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I hear this will provide the chance to reevaluate Youswell Coal Mine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.02,0:21:35.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the personnel at the Eastern Command Center who oversee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.18,0:21:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.55,0:21:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That'll probably make it \Na little easier to live out east.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.85,0:21:42.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rejoice! Even if we are relocated, we'll be able to take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.28,0:21:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you meant for \Nthis to happen from the start!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.82,0:21:50.77,Dialogue,,60,60,0,,Perhaps. More importantly, it would be nice \Nif the women in the east were pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.77,0:21:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Also, their reputations are quickly spreading throughout the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.40,0:21:59.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're saying that there is a champion of the people among the dogs of the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.84,0:22:01.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward Elric?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.72,0:22:03.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.64,0:22:06.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, what kind of guy is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.34,0:22:09.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the stories, \Ndespite being a State Alchemist,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:11.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,he's a friend to the common man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.54,0:22:14.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He must be a fairly \Nupstanding man then, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:18.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But they also say he's short, like a little bean sprout.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:22.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling "miniature size"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.38,0:22:22.72,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.72,0:22:26.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hold it! Hold it! Hold it! Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:26.24,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,Brother! If you keep running like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.24,0:22:28.69,Dialogue Alt,,0,0,0,,you'll never keep up the strength to reach the town of Liore!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.03,0:23:40.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:43.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 10: "Psiren, the Phantom Thief"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.75,0:23:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Say, Brother, isn't it strange how there are people
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.30,0:23:49.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who you can't tell \Nwhether they're good or bad?
